{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15689","headline":"赠衡岳隐禅师 · 司空曙","name":"赠衡岳隐禅师","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"拥褐安居南岳头，白云高寺见衡州。\n石窗湖水摇寒月，枫树猨声报夜秋。\n讲席旧逢山鸟至，梵经初向竺僧求。\n垂垂身老将传法，因下人间逐北游。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"司空曙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15689.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15689","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}